OL,14,     GO'Leary, Irish fiddle-player
OL,15,     GMartin Hayes recalls playing with
OL,16,     Gthe Tulla Ceili Band, founded in
OL,17,     G1946 and still going, and
OL,18,     Gdemystifies jigs and reels.
